yocto-recipe-debugger is licensed under the MIT License, except for one file:

  src/yocto_recipe_debugger/backend.py   GPL-2.0-only

backend.py imports BitBake (GPL-2.0-only) and contains code ported from
BitBake's bb/data_smart.py.  It runs as a separate process and talks to
the language server only through a pipe (JSON lines).

